  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like inflict light wounds, except that you deal 2d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +10).",
    "search_text": "Inflict Moderate Wounds functions like Inflict Light Wounds. By touch, it deals a living creature 2d8 damage plus 1 per caster level, maximum +10, with a Will save for half and spell resistance. It cures an undead creature by the same amount instead of harming it.",
